Documents is Glass HQ's document viewer and Markdown converter, built on
Firecrawl's anydoc.

Upstream project: https://github.com/firecrawl/anydoc
Original fork point: v0.1.7 (commit 4a45addbd607e8b59f0c263bca26aab228e10370)

The document parsing and Markdown conversion core originated in the upstream
project and remains copyright Sideguide Technologies Inc. Glass HQ's format
registry, viewer, renderers, packaging and other modifications are copyright
Glass HQ. The upstream work and the fork's modifications are distributed under
the MIT License included in LICENSE.

The Git history before the fork point is retained in this repository.

The published package ships pdf.js's worker and renderer worker
(pdf.worker.min.mjs, pdf.renderer.min.mjs), copyright Mozilla Foundation and
licensed under the Apache License 2.0, with their license headers intact. Its
two WebAssembly builds of the core statically include the Rust crates listed in
Cargo.lock, under their own licenses. JavaScript dependencies are installed
from npm under their own licenses.
